<title>USA: Allmerica Property defers dividend.</title>
<headline>Allmerica Property defers dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allmerica Property &amp; Casualty Cos Inc said Tuesday that its board has decided to defer action on a third quarter dividend to shareholders, in light of the company's anticipated merger with Allmerica Financial Corp .</p>
<p>The two companies in February announced they had signed a definitive pact for Allmerica Financial to acquire the 40.5 percent of Allmerica P&amp;C that it does not already own.</p>
</text>
